    {
      "id": "1557097231054798940",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T18:28:29.351+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "So the idea was to make it super obvious which way around to put the die (assuming you can see the markings on the die).  This is what a run 2 die looks like.  You are allowed to remove the wafer space logo, but not the arrow in the top right or the QR code  in the bottom left:",
      "author": {
        "id": "691780627338625077",
        "name": "rebelmike",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "RebelMike",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "2026-10_media/49aaff687e56f04e7bbdedf0077bab75-7DDB4.png"
      },
      "attachments": [
        {
          "id": "1557097230505087087",
          "url": "2026-10_media/image-9DC9E.png",
          "fileName": "image.png",
          "fileSizeBytes": 61678
        }
      ],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1557098282545840189",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T18:32:40.046+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "So things are now in the same position on the CoB and the die.  The arrow always matches, and the wafer space logo matches providing the user hasn't removed it.\n\nPin 1 is in the bottom left, and is indicated by QR code on the die and by the circle on the CoB.  I see there's potential for this to be confusing because the arrow and logo markings are a bit more obvious - but as everything is now the same way round as it is in klayout/OpenROAD it is hopefully unlikely that users would get confused.",
      "author": {
        "id": "691780627338625077",
        "name": "rebelmike",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "RebelMike",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "2026-10_media/49aaff687e56f04e7bbdedf0077bab75-7DDB4.png"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1557099801349198047",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T18:38:42.157+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "That said - there's potential for making the arrow smaller and/or the pin 1 circle bigger, or having some other marking to make it more obvious.",
      "author": {
        "id": "691780627338625077",
        "name": "rebelmike",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "RebelMike",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "2026-10_media/49aaff687e56f04e7bbdedf0077bab75-7DDB4.png"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
