    },
    {
      "id": "1557101488243740692",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T18:45:24.344+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Or were you referring to pin 1 on the mezzanine connector?  It does seem like it would be a good idea to put a little arrow next to that!\n\nAnd it would be good to update the standard breakouts so the wafer space logo on them is the same way up as the wafer space logo on the CoB",
